          "Metadata",
          "Service",
          "Singlelayer",
          "Hosted Service"
        ],
        "description": "<p>This data layer shows locations of oil and gas wells that were designated to be part of the Type Logs Project, which created extended data for wells. Some of the extended data includes the well tops for each well and the owner of the tops, the result of the Type Log Committee evaluation of the tops, the Stratigraphic Units for the Type Log Project &amp; CO2 Project, the Committee members for the Type Log Project who selected and evaluated the tops, and LAS 3.0 files. The type LAS 3.0 file includes the final files containing the Log Data, Tops Data, and, if present, the Geologist Report Data. These files are part of the final deliverables for the Type Log Project and are also part of the CO2 Project mapper program to allow users to build General Cross Sections. This project was conducted by the Energy Research Department of the <a target='_blank' href='https://kgs.ku.edu' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Kansas Geological Survey</a>.&nbsp;</p>",
