          "Feature Service",
          "Metadata",
          "Service",
          "Singlelayer",
          "Hosted Service"
        ],
        "description": "<p>This data layer shows cumulative oil production in Kansas aggregated by section. Production is measured in barrels (bbls) and represents total production reported through the most recent quarter. The production data is reported to the Kansas Department of Revenue by oil and gas lease. The data is then passed to the <a target='_blank' href='https://kgs.ku.edu' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Kansas Geological Survey</a> (KGS) and aggregated by section-township-range.&nbsp;</p><p>Data is updated quarterly and managed by the KGS. A point representation of this layer is available on request by contacting <a href='mailto:kgs.gis@ku.edu' rel='nofollow ugc'>kgs.gis@ku.edu</a>.&nbsp;</p>",
        "licenseInfo": "<div style='text-align:Left;font-size:12pt'><p><span>None. Users can determine if this data fits their purposes.</span></p></div>",
